text = "LIGHT LAB - walk down the hall
1: DirectionalLight4D - auto-rotating sun, watch it fade in/out of the slice
2: OmniLight4D - range attenuation 2.0 (left) vs 3.0 (right)
3: OmniLight4D - light size sharp (left) vs soft (right)
4: SpotLight4D - angle attenuation hard (left) vs soft (right)
5: Atrium - WorldEnvironment4D sky + two DirectionalLight4D suns at once"
